Package: SpatialESSSPARKLE
Type: Package
Title: SPARKLE-to-SpatialESS Integration Workflow
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: person("DENG", "Zifeng", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "zifengd8@gmail.com")
Author: Zifeng DENG [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Zifeng DENG <zifengd8@gmail.com>
Description: Provides a reproducible bridge from SPARKLE-corrected AnnData
    files to the exact, memory-efficient SpatialESS implementation of the
    tested SpatialCellChat V3 probability and permutation workflow. The bridge
    preserves sparse expression, cell order, spatial coordinates and group
    labels, and can normalize selected signaling genes using library sizes
    computed over the complete expression matrix. The bundled SpatialESS engine also provides sample-level multi-patient modelling with a patient random intercept.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
